{"about_the_game":"<strong>An epic snowball fight between 2-6 players, both online and local multiplayer. Grow your snowball and use different power-up's to knock your friends out! Are you ready to Brawll?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><i>&quot;SNOWBALL INCOMINGGG!&quot;</i></strong></li></ul>Throw your snowball to knock them out. But don't miss, you are extremely vulnerable without a snowball.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif3.gif?t=1746273202\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><i>&quot;FULL CHARGEEE!&quot;</i></strong></li></ul>Get in a head-to-head battle and headbutt your friends like a stubborn goat.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif1.gif?t=1746273202\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTERACT WITH THE MAP</h2>The map is yours to get the upper hand. Use it and surprise your friends.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><i>&quot;PORTALS!&quot;</i></strong></li></ul>Use the portals located in the map to hit them when they are not expecting! (Have you tried throwing your snowball to the portal?)<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif2.gif?t=1746273202\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><i>&quot;OMG! MAP IS CHANGING&quot;</i></strong></li></ul>Hit the bell, move the blocks to have some unexpected falls!<br><br><i><strong>&quot;An animal takes a step and falls from the moved block you think that of me? No, I am the one who hits the bell.&quot;</strong></i><br>                                                     <strong>- Emperor Penguin</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif4.gif?t=1746273202\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MOST IMPORTANTLY</h2>Don't forget to have fun and show your friends that you are better than them in video games.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif7.gif?t=1746273202\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2247510?t=1746273202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/9ff707c8a7080ca6b178afe61ab0e325bf9da93e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746273202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/603aa5a10610ee10738a41cc21ad19bf903df262/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746273202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/603aa5a10610ee10738a41cc21ad19bf903df262/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746273202","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>An epic snowball fight between 2-6 players, both online and local multiplayer. Grow your snowball and use different power-up's to knock your friends out! Are you ready to Brawll?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><i>&quot;SNOWBALL INCOMINGGG!&quot;</i></strong></li></ul>Throw your snowball to knock them out. But don't miss, you are extremely vulnerable without a snowball.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/gif3.gif?t=1746273202\" />